  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The bravo is capable of instilling brief—yet powerful—moments of uncertainty and doubt in those that he wishes to catch off guard.</em></p>\n<p>At 1st level, as long as the bravo has martial focus, he can make a confounding strike against a creature as an immediate action whenever he succeeds an attack roll or combat maneuver against them (and they are within close range). The creature must succeed at a Will saving throw (using the sphere DC of the bravo’s chosen whim) or become uncertain for 1 round + 1 round per 4 bravo levels he possesses.</p>\n<p>This is a mind-affecting, emotion, and disorientation effect.</p>\n<p>At 7th level, the creature instead becomes shocked on a failed save, or uncertain for the duration on a successful save.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
